},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Freedesktop SDK 24.08 (Flatpak runtime) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (RADV NAVI21) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-10900K CPU @ 3.70GHz (20 threads) - 62.63 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nLock View Rotation option in Spatial editor is ignored after opening or creating a new scene, yet it still shows the \"View Rotation Locked\" indicator in the UI. Option works again as expected after disabling and reenabling.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start Godot on an empty project\n2. In 3D View, click the \"⋮Perspective\" button and enable Lock View Rotation\n3. Verify that rotation stays locked in place when using the middle mouse button\n4. Create new scene with the + button\n5. Rotation is not locked any more despite Lock View Rotation still being enabled\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot necessary","closed_by":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ry